data: {"id": "1ef7d5c3ec8748a4-thinking-parallel_evidence-1623", "run_id": "1ef7d5c3ec8748a4", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论\n\n### 已采集事实\n\n**1. Pod 当前状态与探针配置（k8s canonical）**\n- Pod 为 `Running`，但 `READY=False`，条件 `ContainersNotReady: app` 未就绪。\n- **Readiness Probe**: `http-get http://:18081/ready`，delay=5s, timeout=1s, period=5s, failureThreshold=1。\n- **关键冲突**：Pod YAML 中容器启动命令打印 `listening on 18080`，ThreadingHTTPServer 绑定在 **18080** 端口；且 `do_GET` 逻辑仅对 `/health` 路径返回 200。而 readiness probe 探测的是 **18081:18081/ready** 端口和路径。\n\n**2. 事件（Events）**\n- 52 分钟内 kubelet 连续 640 次 `Readiness probe failed`，原文：`Get \"http://172.16.1", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789389562297, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

